le=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/89c910bb7111e8e89edf1d335e43b633.poster.avif?t=1787409026\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/89c910bb7111e8e89edf1d335e43b633.webm?t=1787409026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/89c910bb7111e8e89edf1d335e43b633.mp4?t=1787409026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/64016e4e1afb7f2aa0b60df3f3d3f1c8.webp?t=1787409026\" width=620 height=50 /></span><br>Penkura offers a range of buildings, machines, bots, and items to construct using the &quot;MMC&quot; (Molecular Matter Converter) or &quot;CCC&quot; (Command Control Communication) for a top-down perspective to build your base. Take control of your bots to explore or perform repairs from the safety of your base. Unleash the potential of the CCC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/fd39c2c8d06231e75965ab573d7a9488.poster.avif?t=1787409026\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/fd39c2c8d06231e75965ab573d7a9488.webm?t=1787409026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/fd39c2c8d06231e75965ab573d7a9488.mp4?t=1787409026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into the immersive world of Penkura's campaign mode, offering rich adventures. While currently under development. In co-op mode, you'll have the ability to construct massive stations and explore additional maps outside of adventure mode for added challenges as you tackle the new world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/64016e4e1afb7f2aa0b60df3f3d3f1c8.webp?t=1787409026\" width=620 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/e03c0f6622b4e582956ebdcb93dc5576.avif?t=1787409026\" width=616 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deep beneath Antarctic ice, a Polish research team uncovers an ancient temple, a portal to a captivating new world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As Earth faces overpopulation and devastation, Project &quot;Gemini&quot; initiates the migration of humanity to this promising planet. For 41 years, pioneers traverse the singularity, until contact is mysteriously severed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now, as a mercenary, you embark on a perilous journey through the unstable gateway, <br>tasked with survival and uncovering the secrets of the unknown world beyond.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/413603e32c4a03764daa8c2efbe5d7c2.poster.avif?t=1787409026\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739720/extras/413603e32c4a03764daa8c2efbe5d7c2.webm?t=17